<body>
<div class="Section1">
<h1 style="font-size:22pt;color:#0f172a;border-bottom:2pt solid #2563eb;padding-bottom:6pt;margin-top:18pt;margin-bottom:12pt;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;">Orgatick — Custom Ticket Template Editor Engineering Documentation</h1><h2 style="font-size:15pt;color:#1e40af;border-bottom:1pt solid #e2e8f0;padding-bottom:4pt;margin-top:16pt;margin-bottom:8pt;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;">1. Executive Summary &amp; Vision</h2><p style="margin:6pt 0;">The <b>Custom Ticket Template Editor</b> is a visual design studio engineered directly inside Orgatick (<code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">apps/organizer</code>). It enables event organizers, operators, and administrators to design, customize, preview, and publish branded event tickets, badges, wristbands, and attendee passes.</p><p style="margin:6pt 0;">It replaces static, hard-coded event tickets with a dynamic, production-quality visual studio where organizers can:</p><li style="margin-bottom:3pt;">Upload and frame custom background artwork (PNG, JPEG, WebP, up to 5MB) with automatic canvas resizing to match natural dimensions (e.g., 1920×1080).</li><li style="margin-bottom:3pt;">Visually drag, resize, rotate, and align dynamic event/attendee data placeholders.</li><li style="margin-bottom:3pt;">Reorder layer hierarchy with native drag-and-drop and normalized z-indexing.</li><li style="margin-bottom:3pt;">Configure typography, text alignment, colors via a fixed ReUI/Base UI Color Picker, quiet zones, and layer properties.</li><li style="margin-bottom:3pt;">Place a tamper-proof official ticket verification QR code complying with Orgatick&#x27;s gate scanner protocol.</li><li style="margin-bottom:3pt;">Preview personalized passes in real-time with diverse sample attendee personas (Standard Attendee, VIP with assigned seating, and long-name stress tests).</li><li style="margin-bottom:3pt;">Navigate efficiently with full keyboard shortcut support (<code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">Ctrl+Z</code>, <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">Ctrl+Y</code>, <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">Ctrl+D</code>, nudges, zoom, grid, preview).</li><h3 style="font-size:12pt;color:#334155;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:6pt;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;">Development &amp; Live Preview Routes</h3><li style="margin-bottom:3pt;"><b>Studio Preview Route</b>: <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">apps/organizer/app/ticket-editor-preview/page.tsx</code>  </li><p style="margin:6pt 0;">  Accessible at: <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">http://localhost:3001/ticket-editor-preview</code> (or via Cloudflare Tunnel: <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">https://dev-org.orgatick.site/ticket-editor-preview</code>).</p><li style="margin-bottom:3pt;"><b>Template Management Route</b>: <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">apps/organizer/app/(dashboard)/ticket-templates/page.tsx</code>  </li><p style="margin:6pt 0;">  Accessible at: <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">http://localhost:3001/ticket-templates</code> (via organizer navigation sidebar).</p><hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;margin:16pt 0;"/><h2 style="font-size:15pt;color:#1e40af;border-bottom:1pt solid #e2e8f0;padding-bottom:4pt;margin-top:16pt;margin-bottom:8pt;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;">2. Monorepo Architecture &amp; Placement</h2><p style="margin:6pt 0;">Orgatick enforces a strict dependency direction: <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">apps/*</code> consumes <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">packages/*</code>, and <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">packages/*</code> never imports from <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">apps/*</code>.</p><pre style="background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;padding:10pt;font-family:Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;font-size:9.5pt;border-radius:4pt;overflow-x:auto;">orgatick/
├── packages/
│   ├── contract/             # @orgatick/contracts (Zod wire contracts, DTOs, Enums)
│   └── ui/                   # @orgatick/ui (Shared Base UI + Tailwind v4 primitives, ReUI ColorPicker)
│
├── apps/
│   ├── organizer/            # apps/organizer (Organizer Operator Dashboard)
│   │   ├── app/
│   │   │   ├── (dashboard)/ticket-templates/  # Template management gallery
│   │   │   └── ticket-editor-preview/         # Standalone studio preview route
│   │   ├── components/ticket-editor/          # 15 focused UI components (&lt; 200 lines each)
│   │   └── lib/ticket-editor/                 # 16 store, math, registry &amp; helper modules
│   │
│   └── backend/              # apps/backend (NestJS API &amp; Rendering Engine)
│       └── src/modules/ticket-template/       # (Planned) Entities, controllers, SVG/PNG renderer
</pre><h3 style="font-size:12pt;color:#334155;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:6pt;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;">Strict Modular Decomposition (&lt; 225 Lines Rule)</h3><p style="margin:6pt 0;">Every single file in the ticket editor module strictly adheres to Orgatick&#x27;s modularity guidelines. The module comprises <b>31 files</b> totaling 3,177 lines of TypeScript and React code, with the largest file being 225 lines:</p><table border="1" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;margin:12pt 0;font-size:10pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><tr style="background:#f1f5f9;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;"><th style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Category</th><th style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">File</th><th style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Lines</th><th style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Responsibility</th></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Components</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">ticket-editor.tsx</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">85</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Studio root container, keyboard shortcuts listener, modal manager</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Components</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">editor-header.tsx</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">169</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Top utility bar: title, zoom, undo/redo, background trigger, preview</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Components</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">editor-canvas.tsx</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">90</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Center stage: CSS scale zoom, bounding box, 8 resize handles</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Components</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">editor-element-view.tsx</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">130</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Element renderer: text, badges, QR, logo, lock/hidden states</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Components</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">editor-field-library.tsx</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">122</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Left sidebar: dynamic field accordion, search, drag triggers</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Components</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">editor-inspector.tsx</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">70</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Right sidebar shell: tabs for Properties and Draggable Layers</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Components</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">editor-layers-panel.tsx</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">188</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Draggable layer stack: HTML5 drag-and-drop, lock, hide, delete</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Components</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">inspector-geometry.tsx</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">132</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Element geometry inspector: X, Y, W, H, rotation, opacity, z-index</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Components</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">inspector-typography.tsx</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">138</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Typography inspector: font family, size, weight, align, color picker</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Components</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">inspector-qr.tsx</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">91</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">QR inspector: quiet zone margin, colors, error correction</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Components</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">inspector-canvas-settings.tsx</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">102</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Canvas setup: presets, dimensions, background color, grid snap</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Components</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">background-uploader.tsx</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">103</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">5MB artwork uploader: drag-drop, dimension reading, auto-sizing</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Components</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">editor-background-modal.tsx</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">156</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Modal dialog for background artwork management &amp; presets</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Components</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">editor-preview-modal.tsx</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">167</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Live simulation modal: persona switcher, zoom, QR gate scanner</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Components</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">editor-shortcuts-modal.tsx</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">83</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Keyboard shortcuts cheat sheet dialog</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Lib / Store</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">editor.store.ts</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">225</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Zustand store definition: elements, canvas, selection, history actions</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Lib / Store</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">store-helpers.ts</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">66</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Pure state transformers: layer reordering, lock/hide, duplicate, delete</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Lib / Store</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">history-helpers.ts</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">19</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">50-step undo/redo snapshot buffer management</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Lib / Store</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">canvas-resize-helpers.ts</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">61</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Proportional coordinate re-scaling on canvas dimension change</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Lib / Store</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">coordinate-helpers.ts</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">79</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Viewport-to-canvas coordinate translation, grid snapping math</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Lib / Store</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">default-template.ts</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">166</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Sensible default template with sample elements</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Lib / Store</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">field-registry.ts</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">12</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Dynamic field registry aggregator</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Lib / Store</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">fields-attendee-event.ts</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">113</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Field definitions for Attendee &amp; Event categories</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Lib / Store</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">fields-ticket-seating.ts</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">156</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Field definitions for Ticket, Seating, and Static categories</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Lib / Store</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">sample-attendees.ts</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">70</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Realistic attendee personas for live testing</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Lib / Store</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">shortcuts-config.ts</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">28</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Keyboard shortcut definitions &amp; categorizations</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Lib / Store</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">use-editor-shortcuts.ts</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">155</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Event listener hook with input-safe hotkey detection</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Lib / Store</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">qr-renderer.tsx</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">96</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Lightweight vector SVG QR code matrix generator</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Lib / Store</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">canvas-presets.ts</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">24</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Canvas dimension presets (Horizontal, Badge, Wristband, 1080p)</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Lib / Store</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">editor-types.ts</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">78</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Complete TypeScript interfaces &amp; type definitions</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Lib / Store</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">editor-constants.ts</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">3</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Constant boundaries (min element size, history limit)</td></tr></table><hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;margin:16pt 0;"/><h2 style="font-size:15pt;color:#1e40af;border-bottom:1pt solid #e2e8f0;padding-bottom:4pt;margin-top:16pt;margin-bottom:8pt;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;">3. State Management Architecture (Zustand)</h2><p style="margin:6pt 0;">State is managed centrally via <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">useTicketEditorStore</code> in <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">apps/organizer/lib/ticket-editor/editor.store.ts</code> with <b>zero prop drilling</b>.</p><h3 style="font-size:12pt;color:#334155;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:6pt;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;">3.1 Store State Shape</h3><pre style="background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;padding:10pt;font-family:Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;font-size:9.5pt;border-radius:4pt;overflow-x:auto;">interface TicketEditorState {
  template: TicketTemplateDefinition;
  selectedElementId: string | null;
  zoom: number;                 // 0.5 to 2.0 (50% to 200%)
  showGrid: boolean;
  snapToGrid: boolean;
  gridSize: number;             // Default 10px
  history: TicketTemplateDefinition[]; // Max 50 snapshots
  historyIndex: number;
  previewOpen: boolean;
  backgroundModalOpen: boolean;
  shortcutsModalOpen: boolean;
  previewPersonaId: string;
}
</pre><h3 style="font-size:12pt;color:#334155;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:6pt;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;">3.2 Snapshot-Based Undo/Redo Engine</h3><li style="margin-bottom:3pt;">Any mutating action (element move, resize, property change, layer reorder, dimension change, deletion) captures a deep snapshot of the <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">template</code> object before applying changes.</li><li style="margin-bottom:3pt;">The history stack is capped at 50 snapshots (<code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">MAX_HISTORY_SNAPSHOTS = 50</code>) to maintain a minimal memory footprint.</li><li style="margin-bottom:3pt;">Pressing <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">Ctrl+Z</code> decrements <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">historyIndex</code> and restores the previous snapshot; <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">Ctrl+Y</code> increments <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">historyIndex</code>.</li><li style="margin-bottom:3pt;">The header displays real-time badges indicating available undo and redo counts.</li><h3 style="font-size:12pt;color:#334155;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:6pt;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;">3.3 Atomic Helpers Separation</h3><p style="margin:6pt 0;">To keep <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">editor.store.ts</code> compact and strictly maintainable:</p><li style="margin-bottom:3pt;">State mutators are extracted to <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">store-helpers.ts</code> (<code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">moveElementLayerHelper</code>, <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">duplicateElementHelper</code>, <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">deleteElementHelper</code>, <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">toggleLockHelper</code>, <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">toggleHiddenHelper</code>).</li><li style="margin-bottom:3pt;">Snapshot history manipulation is isolated in <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">history-helpers.ts</code>.</li><li style="margin-bottom:3pt;">Coordinate calculations reside in <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">coordinate-helpers.ts</code>.</li><hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;margin:16pt 0;"/><h2 style="font-size:15pt;color:#1e40af;border-bottom:1pt solid #e2e8f0;padding-bottom:4pt;margin-top:16pt;margin-bottom:8pt;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;">4. Canvas Geometry &amp; Coordinate Translation</h2><h3 style="font-size:12pt;color:#334155;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:6pt;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;">4.1 Logical Coordinates vs. Viewport Scaling</h3><p style="margin:6pt 0;">The canvas operates on an absolute <b>logical coordinate space</b> independent of the browser&#x27;s physical viewport.</p><li style="margin-bottom:3pt;">Default resolution: <b>1200 × 600 px</b> (or custom up to <b>1920 × 1080 px</b> Full HD).</li><li style="margin-bottom:3pt;">The center stage applies CSS scaling via <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">transform: scale(zoom)</code> with <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">transform-origin: top left</code>.</li><li style="margin-bottom:3pt;">Container rules enforce strict bounds using <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">minWidth</code>, <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">maxWidth</code>, <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">minHeight</code>, and <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">maxHeight</code> matching <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">canvas.width * zoom</code> and <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">canvas.height * zoom</code>, guaranteeing pixel-accurate aspect ratio rendering without layout jitter or scrollbar popping.</li><h3 style="font-size:12pt;color:#334155;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:6pt;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;">4.2 Coordinate Normalization Formula</h3><p style="margin:6pt 0;">When dragging or resizing elements, client mouse coordinates are translated into logical canvas coordinates without floating-point drift:</p><p style="margin:6pt 0;">$$\text{canvasX} = \frac{\text{clientX} - \text{canvasRect.left}}{\text{zoom}}$$</p><p style="margin:6pt 0;">$$\text{canvasY} = \frac{\text{clientY} - \text{canvasRect.top}}{\text{zoom}}$$</p><h3 style="font-size:12pt;color:#334155;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:6pt;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;">4.3 Snapping &amp; Boundary Constraints</h3><li style="margin-bottom:3pt;"><b>Grid Snapping</b>: When <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">snapToGrid</code> is enabled:</li><p style="margin:6pt 0;">  $$\text{snappedX} = \text{round}\left(\frac{\text{canvasX}}{\text{gridSize}}\right) \times \text{gridSize}$$</p><li style="margin-bottom:3pt;"><b>Minimum Element Size</b>: Elements enforce a strict floor of $20\text{px} \times 20\text{px}$ to prevent inverted bounding boxes during resize operations.</li><li style="margin-bottom:3pt;"><b>8 Interactive Resize Handles</b>: Handles located at NW, N, NE, E, SE, S, SW, W allow freeform and proportional scaling.</li><hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;margin:16pt 0;"/><h2 style="font-size:15pt;color:#1e40af;border-bottom:1pt solid #e2e8f0;padding-bottom:4pt;margin-top:16pt;margin-bottom:8pt;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;">5. Background Artwork &amp; Dynamic Canvas Auto-Sizing</h2><h3 style="font-size:12pt;color:#334155;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:6pt;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;">5.1 Artwork Upload Specifications</h3><li style="margin-bottom:3pt;">Supported formats: <b>PNG, JPEG, WebP, SVG</b>.</li><li style="margin-bottom:3pt;">Maximum file size: <b>5MB</b> (strictly validated in <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">background-uploader.tsx</code>).</li><li style="margin-bottom:3pt;">Organizers can upload custom background artwork via drag-and-drop or file picker.</li><h3 style="font-size:12pt;color:#334155;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:6pt;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;">5.2 Natural Dimension Detection</h3><p style="margin:6pt 0;">Using the browser&#x27;s <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">Image()</code> API, the editor extracts the intrinsic pixel dimensions:</p><pre style="background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;padding:10pt;font-family:Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;font-size:9.5pt;border-radius:4pt;overflow-x:auto;">const img = new Image();
img.onload = () =&gt; {
  const naturalWidth = img.naturalWidth;
  const naturalHeight = img.naturalHeight;
  // Offers automatic canvas resizing to match artwork
};
img.src = dataUrl;
</pre><h3 style="font-size:12pt;color:#334155;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:6pt;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;">5.3 Proportional Coordinate Re-scaling Algorithm</h3><p style="margin:6pt 0;">When an organizer chooses to resize the canvas to match uploaded artwork (e.g., from $1200 \times 600$ to $1920 \times 1080$), all existing elements are automatically rescaled proportionally via <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">canvas-resize-helpers.ts</code>:</p><p style="margin:6pt 0;">$$\text{scaleX} = \frac{W_{\text{new}}}{W_{\text{old}}},\quad \text{scaleY} = \frac{H_{\text{new}}}{H_{\text{old}}}$$</p><p style="margin:6pt 0;">$$X&#x27; = \text{round}(X \times \text{scaleX}),\quad Y&#x27; = \text{round}(Y \times \text{scaleY})$$</p><p style="margin:6pt 0;">$$W_{\text{element}}&#x27; = \max\left(20, \text{round}(W_{\text{element}} \times \text{scaleX})\right)$$</p><p style="margin:6pt 0;">$$H_{\text{element}}&#x27; = \max\left(20, \text{round}(H_{\text{element}} \times \text{scaleY})\right)$$</p><p style="margin:6pt 0;">$$\text{fontSize}&#x27; = \max\left(8, \text{round}(\text{fontSize} \times \min(\text{scaleX}, \text{scaleY}))\right)$$</p><p style="margin:6pt 0;"><b>Guarantees</b>: No elements are lost, placed off-screen, or shrunk below readable thresholds.</p><hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;margin:16pt 0;"/><h2 style="font-size:15pt;color:#1e40af;border-bottom:1pt solid #e2e8f0;padding-bottom:4pt;margin-top:16pt;margin-bottom:8pt;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;">6. Draggable Layer Hierarchy &amp; Reordering</h2><p style="margin:6pt 0;">Organizers manage the depth and stacking order of elements through a dedicated <b>Layers Panel</b> (<code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">editor-layers-panel.tsx</code>) integrated into the inspector sidebar.</p><pre style="background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;padding:10pt;font-family:Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;font-size:9.5pt;border-radius:4pt;overflow-x:auto;">┌───────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ [ Properties ]       [ Layers (5) ]           │
├───────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ ≡  [QR]   Official Verification QR   👁  🔓 🗑│
│ ≡  [TEXT] Attendee Name             👁  🔓 🗑│
│ ─── (Visual insertion indicator) ───────────  │
│ ≡  [BADGE] Ticket Tier Badge        👁  🔒 🗑│
│ ≡  [TEXT] Event Date &amp; Venue        👁  🔓 🗑│
│ ≡  [IMG]  Event Brand Logo          👁  🔓 🗑│
└───────────────────────────────────────────────┘
</pre><h3 style="font-size:12pt;color:#334155;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:6pt;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;">6.1 Native HTML5 Drag and Drop</h3><li style="margin-bottom:3pt;">Implemented using native browser drag-and-drop (<code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">draggable</code>, <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">onDragStart</code>, <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">onDragOver</code>, <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">onDragLeave</code>, <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">onDrop</code>) to eliminate bulky external libraries and avoid React 19 compatibility issues.</li><li style="margin-bottom:3pt;">Provides a clear visual insertion line indicator (<code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">border-t-2 border-primary</code> or <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">border-b-2 border-primary</code>) to show exactly where the dropped element will land.</li><h3 style="font-size:12pt;color:#334155;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:6pt;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;">6.2 Z-Index Normalization Algorithm</h3><p style="margin:6pt 0;">To prevent z-index collisions and arbitrary gaps, reordering normalizes the entire layer stack sequentially:</p><pre style="background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;padding:10pt;font-family:Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;font-size:9.5pt;border-radius:4pt;overflow-x:auto;">// store-helpers.ts: moveElementLayerHelper
const updated = [...elements];
const [moved] = updated.splice(sourceIndex, 1);
updated.splice(destinationIndex, 0, moved);

// Re-index sequentially from top (highest zIndex) to bottom (1)
const total = updated.length;
return updated.map((el, idx) =&gt; ({
  ...el,
  zIndex: total - idx,
}));
</pre><h3 style="font-size:12pt;color:#334155;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:6pt;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;">6.3 Layer Controls</h3><li style="margin-bottom:3pt;"><b>Selection</b>: Clicking any layer highlights and selects that element on the canvas stage.</li><li style="margin-bottom:3pt;"><b>Visibility Toggle (<code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">hidden</code>)</b>: Hides the element from the canvas and preview without deleting it.</li><li style="margin-bottom:3pt;"><b>Lock Toggle (<code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">locked</code>)</b>: Freezes element position, dimensions, and selection to prevent accidental edits.</li><li style="margin-bottom:3pt;"><b>Delete</b>: Removes the element with an automatic undo/redo snapshot.</li><hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;margin:16pt 0;"/><h2 style="font-size:15pt;color:#1e40af;border-bottom:1pt solid #e2e8f0;padding-bottom:4pt;margin-top:16pt;margin-bottom:8pt;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;">7. ReUI Color Picker Architecture &amp; Tailwind v4 Fixes</h2><p style="margin:6pt 0;">The ticket editor integrates <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">@orgatick/ui</code>&#x27;s <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">ColorPicker</code> primitive (<code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">packages/ui/src/components/reui/color-picker.tsx</code>).</p><h3 style="font-size:12pt;color:#334155;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:6pt;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;">7.1 Root-Cause Analysis of Previous Failures</h3><p style="margin:6pt 0;">When tested in the inspector and modals, the ColorPicker collapsed into an invisible or stretched layout. The root causes were:</p><p style="margin:6pt 0;">1. <b>Invalid Tailwind v4 Syntax</b>: The component used <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">w-(--color-picker-content-width)</code> and <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">[--color-picker-content-width:--spacing(72)]</code>. In Tailwind v4, <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">--spacing(72)</code> is invalid CSS, and <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">tailwind-merge</code> ignored the arbitrary property, allowing Base UI&#x27;s internal <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">w-full</code> to override it.</p><p style="margin:6pt 0;">2. <b>Popover Viewport Clamping</b>: Base UI Popover rendered directly downward, colliding with the bottom of the viewport inside scrolling inspectors and clamping its height to 0.</p><p style="margin:6pt 0;">3. <b>Flex Child Collapse</b>: The saturation gradient area (<code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">ColorPickerArea</code>) lacked <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">shrink-0</code>, causing flex layout compression to collapse its height to 0.</p><p style="margin:6pt 0;">4. <b>CSS Gradient Rendering</b>: Multi-layer dynamic Tailwind classes for hue, saturation, and lightness failed to render properly across browsers.</p><p style="margin:6pt 0;">5. <b>Slider Thumb Drift</b>: Slider thumbs traveled beyond track bounds due to incorrect fractional travel math.</p><h3 style="font-size:12pt;color:#334155;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:6pt;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;">7.2 Applied Fixes in `color-picker.tsx`</h3><li style="margin-bottom:3pt;"><b>Fixed Popover Width</b>: Replaced arbitrary CSS variables with standard <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">w-72 sm:w-80</code> classes so <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">tailwind-merge</code> reliably sets the popover width.</li><li style="margin-bottom:3pt;"><b>Placement &amp; Offsets</b>: Added <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">side=&quot;top&quot;</code> and <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">sideOffset={8}</code> to prevent clamping against the viewport bottom.</li><li style="margin-bottom:3pt;"><b>Guaranteed Area Height</b>: Enforced <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">h-36 min-h-[144px] shrink-0</code> on <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">ColorPickerArea</code> with pure inline cross-browser gradients:</li><p style="margin:6pt 0;">  <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;"></code>`typescript</p><p style="margin:6pt 0;">  // Saturation (white to transparent) + Lightness (black to transparent)</p><p style="margin:6pt 0;">  background: `</p><p style="margin:6pt 0;">    linear-gradient(to top, #000, transparent),</p><p style="margin:6pt 0;">    linear-gradient(to right, #fff, transparent),</p><p style="margin:6pt 0;">    hsl(${hue}, 100%, 50%)</p><p style="margin:6pt 0;">  `</p><p style="margin:6pt 0;">  <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;"></code>`</p><li style="margin-bottom:3pt;"><b>Pixel-Accurate Slider Travel</b>: Implemented constrained thumb positioning:</li><p style="margin:6pt 0;">  <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;"></code>`typescript</p><p style="margin:6pt 0;">  left: <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">calc(8px + (100% - 16px) * ${fraction})</code></p><p style="margin:6pt 0;">  <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;"></code>`</p><li style="margin-bottom:3pt;"><b>Palette Swatches</b>: Built a standard <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">flex flex-wrap gap-1.5</code> swatch grid with rounded chips and active checkmark indicators.</li><hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;margin:16pt 0;"/><h2 style="font-size:15pt;color:#1e40af;border-bottom:1pt solid #e2e8f0;padding-bottom:4pt;margin-top:16pt;margin-bottom:8pt;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;">8. Controlled Dynamic Field Registry</h2><p style="margin:6pt 0;">To prevent arbitrary script injection and ensure ticket validation fidelity, all dynamic elements bind to controlled field identifiers defined in <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">apps/organizer/lib/ticket-editor/field-registry.ts</code>:</p><table border="1" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;margin:12pt 0;font-size:10pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><tr style="background:#f1f5f9;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;"><th style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Category</th><th style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Identifier</th><th style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Display Label</th><th style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Sample Fallback Value</th></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Attendee</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">attendee.name</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Attendee Name</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">&quot;Alex Chen&quot;</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Attendee</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">attendee.email</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Attendee Email</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">&quot;alex.chen@example.com&quot;</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Attendee</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">attendee.id</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Attendee ID</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">&quot;ATT-2026-9042&quot;</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Event</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">event.name</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Event Title</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">&quot;Orgatick Global Summit 2026&quot;</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Event</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">event.date</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Event Date &amp; Time</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">&quot;Saturday, Nov 14, 2026 • 10:00 AM&quot;</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Event</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">event.venue</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Venue / Location</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">&quot;Convention Center, Grand Ballroom&quot;</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Event</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">event.logo</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Event Logo</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">[Logo Image]</code></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Ticket</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">ticket.code</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Ticket Number / Code</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">&quot;ORG-TK-883492&quot;</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Ticket</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">ticket.type</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Ticket Tier Name</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">&quot;All-Access VIP Pass&quot;</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Ticket</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">ticket.orderRef</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Order Reference</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">&quot;ORD-77491&quot;</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Ticket</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">ticket.price</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Ticket Price</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">&quot;$149.00&quot;</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Seating</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">seating.zone</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Zone / Area</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">&quot;VIP Pavilion&quot;</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Seating</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">seating.section</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Section</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">&quot;Section A&quot;</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Seating</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">seating.row</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Row</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">&quot;Row 3&quot;</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Seating</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">seating.seat</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Seat Number</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">&quot;Seat 15&quot;</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>QR Code</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">ticket.verificationQr</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Official Verification QR</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">orgatick://verify/...</code></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Static</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">static.text</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Custom Static Label</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">&quot;ADMIT ONE - NO REFUNDS&quot;</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Static</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">static.image</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Custom Badge / Logo</td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">[Image URL]</code></td></tr></table><hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;margin:16pt 0;"/><h2 style="font-size:15pt;color:#1e40af;border-bottom:1pt solid #e2e8f0;padding-bottom:4pt;margin-top:16pt;margin-bottom:8pt;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;">9. Keyboard Shortcuts Engine</h2><p style="margin:6pt 0;">The editor includes an input-safe keyboard shortcuts system (<code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">use-editor-shortcuts.ts</code>):</p><table border="1" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;margin:12pt 0;font-size:10pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><tr style="background:#f1f5f9;font-weight:bold;text-align:left;"><th style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Action</th><th style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Shortcut (Mac / Win)</th><th style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Description</th></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Undo</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">Cmd+Z</code> / <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">Ctrl+Z</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Revert to previous history snapshot</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Redo</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">Cmd+Shift+Z</code> / <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">Ctrl+Y</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Re-apply reverted history snapshot</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Duplicate</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">Cmd+D</code> / <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">Ctrl+D</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Clone selected element with 20px offset</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Delete</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">Backspace</code> / <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">Delete</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Remove selected element</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Nudge</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">Arrow Keys</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Move selected element by 1px</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Fast Nudge</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">Shift + Arrow Keys</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Move selected element by 10px</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Deselect</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">Escape</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Clear active selection</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Zoom In</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">Cmd++</code> / <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">Ctrl++</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Increase canvas zoom by 10%</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Zoom Out</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">Cmd+-</code> / <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">Ctrl+-</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Decrease canvas zoom by 10%</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Reset Zoom</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">Cmd+0</code> / <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">Ctrl+0</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Reset canvas zoom to 100%</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Toggle Grid</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">G</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Toggle alignment grid visibility</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Toggle Preview</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">P</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Open/close live simulation modal</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><b>Help</b></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;"><code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">?</code></td><td style="padding:6pt 8pt;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;">Open keyboard shortcuts cheat sheet</td></tr></table><h3 style="font-size:12pt;color:#334155;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:6pt;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;">Input-Safe Event Filtering</h3><p style="margin:6pt 0;">Shortcuts are ignored when the user is actively typing in form inputs:</p><pre style="background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;padding:10pt;font-family:Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;font-size:9.5pt;border-radius:4pt;overflow-x:auto;">const target = event.target as HTMLElement;
if (
  target.tagName === &quot;INPUT&quot; ||
  target.tagName === &quot;TEXTAREA&quot; ||
  target.isContentEditable
) {
  // Allow normal text editing without triggering editor hotkeys
  return;
}
</pre><hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;margin:16pt 0;"/><h2 style="font-size:15pt;color:#1e40af;border-bottom:1pt solid #e2e8f0;padding-bottom:4pt;margin-top:16pt;margin-bottom:8pt;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;">10. Live Persona Preview &amp; QR Gate Scanner Simulation</h2><p style="margin:6pt 0;">The <b>Live Preview Modal</b> (<code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">editor-preview-modal.tsx</code>) enables organizers to test templates against real attendee data profiles before publishing.</p><h3 style="font-size:12pt;color:#334155;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:6pt;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;">10.1 Test Personas (`sample-attendees.ts`)</h3><p style="margin:6pt 0;">1. <b>Standard Attendee (&quot;Alex Chen&quot;)</b>:</p><p style="margin:6pt 0;">   - Tier: General Admission ($0.00 / Free)</p><p style="margin:6pt 0;">   - Seating: Open Seating / Standing Area</p><p style="margin:6pt 0;">   - Purpose: Verifies standard typography, date formatting, and baseline alignment.</p><p style="margin:6pt 0;">2. <b>VIP Guest (&quot;Dr. Elena Rostova&quot;)</b>:</p><p style="margin:6pt 0;">   - Tier: All-Access VIP Pass ($249.00)</p><p style="margin:6pt 0;">   - Seating: Zone &quot;VIP Pavilion&quot;, Section &quot;Sec A&quot;, Row &quot;Row 3&quot;, Seat &quot;Seat 15&quot;</p><p style="margin:6pt 0;">   - Purpose: Verifies multi-attribute seating tags, badges, and high-visibility contrast.</p><p style="margin:6pt 0;">3. <b>Stress-Test Persona (&quot;Hubert Blaine Wolfeschlegelsteinhausenbergerdorff Sr.&quot;)</b>:</p><p style="margin:6pt 0;">   - Tier: Ultra-Long VIP Diamond Sponsorship Tier With Extended Access</p><p style="margin:6pt 0;">   - Venue: Metropolitan Convention and Exhibition Center - Hall 4B West Wing Annex</p><p style="margin:6pt 0;">   - Purpose: Verifies text truncation (<code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">text-ellipsis</code>), multi-line wrapping, and boundary collision prevention with QR codes.</p><h3 style="font-size:12pt;color:#334155;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:6pt;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;">10.2 Tamper-Proof QR Matrix Generator (`qr-renderer.tsx`)</h3><li style="margin-bottom:3pt;">Generates an authentic SVG QR code matrix from the ticket&#x27;s verification payload:</li><p style="margin:6pt 0;">  <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">orgatick://verify/tkt_sample_12345?sig=9f83...</code></p><li style="margin-bottom:3pt;">Rendered purely in vector SVG, ensuring zero pixelation at any zoom level or print DPI.</li><h3 style="font-size:12pt;color:#334155;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:6pt;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;">10.3 Interactive Scanner Simulation</h3><p style="margin:6pt 0;">The preview modal includes a &quot;Simulate Gate Scanner&quot; feature:</p><li style="margin-bottom:3pt;">Clicking the scanner sends the QR payload through a simulated validation check.</li><li style="margin-bottom:3pt;">Returns instant visual feedback: ✅ <b>Ticket Valid &amp; Verified</b>, Attendee Name, Tier Badge, and Scanned Timestamp.</li><hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;margin:16pt 0;"/><h2 style="font-size:15pt;color:#1e40af;border-bottom:1pt solid #e2e8f0;padding-bottom:4pt;margin-top:16pt;margin-bottom:8pt;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;">11. Code Quality &amp; Verification Metrics</h2><p style="margin:6pt 0;">The codebase has been verified against Orgatick&#x27;s strict engineering standards:</p><pre style="background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;padding:10pt;font-family:Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;font-size:9.5pt;border-radius:4pt;overflow-x:auto;"># 1. TypeScript Strict Typecheck (organizer app)
pnpm --filter @orgatick/organizer-app run check-types
# Result: 0 errors, 0 warnings

# 2. Biome Linter (organizer app)
pnpm --filter @orgatick/organizer-app run lint
# Result: 0 errors, 0 warnings

# 3. File Size Audit
wc -l apps/organizer/components/ticket-editor/* apps/organizer/lib/ticket-editor/*
# Result: All 31 files strictly &lt; 225 lines (well below the 250 ceiling)
</pre><hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;margin:16pt 0;"/><h2 style="font-size:15pt;color:#1e40af;border-bottom:1pt solid #e2e8f0;padding-bottom:4pt;margin-top:16pt;margin-bottom:8pt;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;">12. Future Backend Persistence &amp; Production Roadmap</h2><p style="margin:6pt 0;">The next phase of development will implement the persistence and server-side rendering pipeline:</p><pre style="background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;padding:10pt;font-family:Consolas,'Courier New',monospace;font-size:9.5pt;border-radius:4pt;overflow-x:auto;">flowchart LR
    A[&quot;Organizer Visual Studio&lt;br/&gt;(apps/organizer)&quot;] --&gt;|Saves Draft / Publishes| B[&quot;Zod Wire Contracts&lt;br/&gt;(@orgatick/contracts)&quot;]
    B --&gt;|REST API with OrganizationContextGuard| C[&quot;TicketTemplateController&lt;br/&gt;(apps/backend)&quot;]
    C --&gt;|Stores JSON Definition| D[(&quot;PostgreSQL&lt;br/&gt;ticketing.ticket_templates&quot;)]
    D --&gt;|On Ticket Issuance| E[&quot;TicketRendererService&lt;br/&gt;(SVG &amp; Resvg / Sharp)&quot;]
    E --&gt;|Generates Print PDF &amp; PNG Pass| F[&quot;Attendee Apple Wallet / PDF Pass&quot;]
</pre><h3 style="font-size:12pt;color:#334155;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:6pt;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;">12.1 Shared Contracts (`packages/contract`)</h3><li style="margin-bottom:3pt;">Implement <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">TicketCanvasSchema</code>, <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">TicketElementSchema</code>, <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">TicketTemplateDefinitionSchema</code>.</li><li style="margin-bottom:3pt;">Implement <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">CreateTicketTemplateSchema</code>, <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">UpdateTicketTemplateSchema</code>, <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">TicketTemplateQuerySchema</code>.</li><li style="margin-bottom:3pt;">Export response envelope schemas via <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">createApiResponseSchema</code> and <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">createPaginatedApiResponseSchema</code>.</li><h3 style="font-size:12pt;color:#334155;margin-top:12pt;margin-bottom:6pt;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;">12.2 Backend Module (`apps/backend`)</h3><li style="margin-bottom:3pt;"><b>Entities</b>:</li><p style="margin:6pt 0;">  - <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">TicketTemplateEntity</code>: Storing <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">organization_id</code>, <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">event_id</code>, <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">name</code>, <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">status</code>, <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">canvas_width</code>, <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">canvas_height</code>, <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">background_url</code>.</p><p style="margin:6pt 0;">  - <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">TicketTemplateVersionEntity</code>: Immutable snapshot of <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">definition</code> (JSONB) linked to issued tickets to guarantee historical reproducibility.</p><li style="margin-bottom:3pt;"><b>Controller &amp; Security</b>:</li><p style="margin:6pt 0;">  - <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">TicketTemplateController</code> protected by <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">OrganizationContextGuard</code> and <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">TICKET_PERMISSIONS</code>.</p><li style="margin-bottom:3pt;"><b>Rendering Engine</b>:</li><p style="margin:6pt 0;">  - Server-side SVG rendering using template definition and attendee data.</p><p style="margin:6pt 0;">  - High-performance rasterization to PNG and vector PDF using <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">@resvg/resvg-js</code> / <code style="background:#f1f5f9;padding:1pt 3pt;border-radius:2pt;font-size:9pt;">pdfkit</code> for email attachments and Apple Wallet passes.</p>
</div>
</body>
</html>
